cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
communication.1	1	communication	names					communication gives what is stored as MTSV, by aggregate only to count an input's values
communication.5	1	communication	records					what the data bank stores is given untransformed and unsorted: records in stored order
communication.2	1	communication	names					names gives _inputs as storage's inputs gives it, then _sheets and _fields as storage keeps them
communication.3	1	communication	records					records gives the records of the values between first and last, both included, of every place, each place's sheet named as _sheets names it
communication.4	1	communication	new					new gives the records from the number communicated to the session and agent to the last value stored, then their records of _stored, then marks every value stored communicated to them
