communication.1	1	before	$PWD/bank/_sheets.mtsv	hook input _sheets
communication.1	1	before	$PWD/bank/_fields.mtsv	hook input _fields
communication.1	1	after	result 1	names of two values
communication.5	1	before	$PWD/bank/$INPUT.mtsv	two values input
communication.5	1	before	$PWD/bank/_stored.mtsv	two values _stored
