communication.5	1	before	$PWD/bank/_fields.mtsv	hook input _fields
communication.5	1	after	result 1	records of value 1
communication.2	1	before	$PWD/bank/_stored.mtsv	two values _stored
communication.2	1	before	$PWD/bank/_sheets.mtsv	hook input _sheets
communication.2	1	before	$PWD/bank/_fields.mtsv	hook input _fields
